<!-- ll-rating demo — mirrors the upstream docs page (#/components/rating). -->
<view class="demo">
  <ll-page-title underline="highlight" seed="rating" custom-style="margin-bottom:16rpx;">Rating</ll-page-title>
  <view class="sec-desc">Stars, hearts or suns somebody drew, where you pick how many are filled. Hover previews, half steps are optional, and it is a real radio group (arrow keys, form value), or a plain read-only display with a text alternative. New in Looseleaf: shadcn has no rating.</view>

  <view class="sec sec--grid">
    <view class="sec-h2">Preview</view>
    <view class="sub-h3">Default</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">Hover to preview, click to choose. It is a radio group: Tab lands on the chosen glyph, then arrow keys, Home and End change the value. (No hover on a phone — taps pick directly.)</view>
    <view class="col-start stack stack--tight">
      <ll-rating value="{{value}}" bind:change="onValue" aria-label="Rate this notebook" />
      <text class="live" aria-live="polite">{{value ? "You gave it " + value + " out of 5." : "Not rated yet."}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec sec--grid">
    <view class="sec-h2">Examples</view>

    <view class="sub-h3">Glyphs, halves and sizes</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">Stars, hearts and suns; allowHalf steps by 0.5 (two radios per glyph, one over each half); max sets how many; three sizes.</view>
    <view class="col-start stack">
      <view class="wrap">
        <ll-rating defaultValue="{{3.5}}" allowHalf aria-label="Stars, halves allowed" />
        <ll-rating icon="heart" defaultValue="{{4}}" aria-label="Hearts" />
        <ll-rating icon="sun" defaultValue="{{2}}" aria-label="Suns" />
      </view>
      <view class="wrap">
        <ll-rating size="sm" defaultValue="{{4}}" aria-label="Small" />
        <ll-rating size="lg" defaultValue="{{4}}" aria-label="Large" />
        <ll-rating max="{{10}}" size="sm" defaultValue="{{7}}" aria-label="Out of ten" />
      </view>
      <view class="wrap">
        <ll-rating defaultValue="{{3}}" clearable aria-label="Clearable: click the chosen glyph again" />
        <ll-rating defaultValue="{{3}}" disabled aria-label="Disabled" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="sub-h3">Review card</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">A real-world use: a read-only display (an image with a text alternative, so no tab stop), a form control with required, and a submit that reads the value.</view>
    <view class="col-center">
      <ll-card seed="review" custom-style="width:100%;max-width:768rpx">
        <ll-card-header>
          <ll-card-title>Field Notes, No. 3</ll-card-title>
          <ll-card-description custom-style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16rpx">
            <ll-rating readOnly value="{{4.5}}" allowHalf size="sm" />
            <text>4.5 from 212 readers</text>
          </ll-card-description>
        </ll-card-header>
        <ll-card-content custom-style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24rpx">
          <view class="stack stack--tight">
            <text class="label">Your rating</text>
            <ll-rating required allowHalf value="{{rating}}" bind:change="onRating" aria-label="Your rating" />
          </view>
          <view class="stack stack--tight">
            <text class="label">A few words</text>
            <ll-textarea placeholder="The paper takes ink beautifully..." aria-label="A few words" />
          </view>
        </ll-card-content>
        <ll-card-footer custom-style="gap:24rpx;align-items:center">
          <ll-button bind:tap="onPost">Post review</ll-button>
          <text class="live" aria-live="polite">{{sent}}</text>
        </ll-card-footer>
      </ll-card>
    </view>

    <view class="sub-h3">Survey rows</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">Several ratings side by side with their own labels and a running summary. Each row is labeled with aria-labelledby; the value text is your own.</view>
    <view class="col-start stack stack--tight survey">
      <view class="row">
        <text class="row-label">Pace</text>
        <ll-rating icon="star" value="{{pace}}" bind:change="onPace" clearable aria-label="Pace" />
      </view>
      <view class="row">
        <text class="row-label">Snacks</text>
        <ll-rating icon="heart" value="{{snacks}}" bind:change="onSnacks" clearable aria-label="Snacks" />
      </view>
      <view class="row">
        <text class="row-label">Sunshine</text>
        <ll-rating icon="sun" value="{{sun}}" bind:change="onSun" clearable aria-label="Sunshine" />
      </view>
      <text class="live">Total: {{pace + snacks + sun}} of 15</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
